{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate is bleeding your planet dry. It's time to steal it back. <strong>SLAMPUNKS</strong> is a 1-3 player co-op action survivor-roguelike where your squad is the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SLAMPUNKS, you team up as rebel punks and actively use momentum and kinetic hero synergies to wipe out hordes and pull off high-stakes heists. Slam, roll, slay, repeat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KINETIC HERO SYNERGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the sentinel corporate hordes, you have to weaponize your friends. Your main tool is the kinetic co-op combos between you and your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starter heroes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitsune:</strong> Grapple onto your teammates, spinning at high speeds to create a lethal slicing chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chonk:</strong> Play as a sentient goo-ball to steamroll through enemies (and friends) like a massive wrecking ball. Combine your abilities and create absolute chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frill:</strong> ...keeps his secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/66f812c22944bec1ac2dd5af9e6b4c40.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/66f812c22944bec1ac2dd5af9e6b4c40.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/66f812c22944bec1ac2dd5af9e6b4c40.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RANDOMIZED HEIST OBJECTIVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 30-minute run throws your squad into a completely different gauntlet. You\u2019re not just trying to survive the clock; you\u2019re executing high-octane corporate sabotage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage:</strong> Smash massive industrial mining rigs to scrap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escort:</strong> Defend the Silver-Sled payload through endless, brutal enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Gather:</strong> Track down elite mini-bosses and steal their glowing Cold Silver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Finale:</strong> Survive long enough to face off against screen-filling, colossal bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/e77d51596c4a79499d7d32864e0d5acc.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/e77d51596c4a79499d7d32864e0d5acc.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/e77d51596c4a79499d7d32864e0d5acc.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET OVERPOWERED &amp; BREAK THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up lets you shape the direction of your run with powerful upgrades, but completing objectives unlocks the real crazy stuff: <strong>Ability Augments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These augments fundamentally change how your kits work. Turn Kitsune's grapple hook into a localized gravity well, or unlock infinite mass for Chonk until you literally outgrow the screen. Stack your upgrades, get ridiculously overpowered, and break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/20a67d8a91ed39b28ef478d6288c7f1b.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/20a67d8a91ed39b28ef478d6288c7f1b.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/20a67d8a91ed39b28ef478d6288c7f1b.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>META-PROGRESSION &amp; THE ARMORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it out alive with stolen Cold Silver and scrap to upgrade The Armory between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy permanent stat boosts, unlock brand-new kit variations, and build out the ultimate rebel arsenal. Even when a run ends in a glorious, explosive wipe, the resources you gathered make you permanently stronger for the next heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/fb2999aa49d0f3e713c8d87af4b7691c.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/fb2999aa49d0f3e713c8d87af4b7691c.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/fb2999aa49d0f3e713c8d87af4b7691c.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN THE REBELLION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to help shape the game, report bugs, share your most absurd co-op moments, or just chat with the devs? Join our Discord community! We're building this alongside our players, and we'd love to have you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605090?t=1773773686","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3605090?t=1773773686","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/76eb636425be81cb25d8968cd1f7fb398ecb91b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773773686","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/76eb636425be81cb25d8968cd1f7fb398ecb91b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773773686","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Cross-Platform Multiplayer","id":27},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>JOIN US!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/971f4305880786427076b36d4fd411ce.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corporate is bleeding your planet dry. It's time to steal it back. <strong>SLAMPUNKS</strong> is a 1-3 player co-op action survivor-roguelike where your squad is the ultimate weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In SLAMPUNKS, you team up as rebel punks and actively use momentum and kinetic hero synergies to wipe out hordes and pull off high-stakes heists. Slam, roll, slay, repeat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KINETIC HERO SYNERGIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive the sentinel corporate hordes, you have to weaponize your friends. Your main tool is the kinetic co-op combos between you and your squad.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starter heroes:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kitsune:</strong> Grapple onto your teammates, spinning at high speeds to create a lethal slicing chain.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chonk:</strong> Play as a sentient goo-ball to steamroll through enemies (and friends) like a massive wrecking ball. Combine your abilities and create absolute chaos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Frill:</strong> ...keeps his secrets.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/66f812c22944bec1ac2dd5af9e6b4c40.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/66f812c22944bec1ac2dd5af9e6b4c40.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/66f812c22944bec1ac2dd5af9e6b4c40.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>RANDOMIZED HEIST OBJECTIVES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every 30-minute run throws your squad into a completely different gauntlet. You\u2019re not just trying to survive the clock; you\u2019re executing high-octane corporate sabotage.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sabotage:</strong> Smash massive industrial mining rigs to scrap.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escort:</strong> Defend the Silver-Sled payload through endless, brutal enemy waves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt &amp; Gather:</strong> Track down elite mini-bosses and steal their glowing Cold Silver.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Finale:</strong> Survive long enough to face off against screen-filling, colossal bosses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/e77d51596c4a79499d7d32864e0d5acc.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/e77d51596c4a79499d7d32864e0d5acc.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/e77d51596c4a79499d7d32864e0d5acc.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GET OVERPOWERED &amp; BREAK THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leveling up lets you shape the direction of your run with powerful upgrades, but completing objectives unlocks the real crazy stuff: <strong>Ability Augments.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These augments fundamentally change how your kits work. Turn Kitsune's grapple hook into a localized gravity well, or unlock infinite mass for Chonk until you literally outgrow the screen. Stack your upgrades, get ridiculously overpowered, and break the game!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/20a67d8a91ed39b28ef478d6288c7f1b.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/20a67d8a91ed39b28ef478d6288c7f1b.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/20a67d8a91ed39b28ef478d6288c7f1b.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>META-PROGRESSION &amp; THE ARMORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make it out alive with stolen Cold Silver and scrap to upgrade The Armory between runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy permanent stat boosts, unlock brand-new kit variations, and build out the ultimate rebel arsenal. Even when a run ends in a glorious, explosive wipe, the resources you gathered make you permanently stronger for the next heist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/fb2999aa49d0f3e713c8d87af4b7691c.poster.avif?t=1773773686\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/fb2999aa49d0f3e713c8d87af4b7691c.webm?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/extras/fb2999aa49d0f3e713c8d87af4b7691c.mp4?t=1773773686\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>JOIN THE REBELLION!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Want to help shape the game, report bugs, share your most absurd co-op moments, or just chat with the devs? Join our Discord community! We're building this alongside our players, and we'd love to have you.</p>","developers":["HALE Gameworks"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3605090/ba58e43630ef86d4b251dc18fd3c5ff7b48d7c06/header.jpg?t=1773773686","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</str